    "classification": "B intended, C implementation defect",
    "finding": "is_nominal_geometry is assigned by candidate-id membership in a four-item reference list, not by simulation/sample role. build_tmm independently canonically emits all 2688 coarse/refined TMM scan records without filtering this flag. The field therefore means reference-candidate identity only when candidate naming is reliable; it also propagates to tolerance geometries carrying a reference candidate_id, so it is not a safe global nominal-sample flag."
